{"id": "official:sentence:469cf1d3-2d1c-44bc-8913-74835f9a7c4e", "text": "我会在这里等着到他回来的。", "shortMeaning": "我会在这里一直等他回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e61e380a-2838-4be2-b94f-a01f831781d4", "text": "我会在那之前见他。", "shortMeaning": "我会在那之前见到他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98c15739-1f96-4480-8ca5-849a842ae36c", "text": "我会在那儿一直待到六点。", "shortMeaning": "我会在那里待到六点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04abef21-0879-4e9e-b043-f5247d789626", "text": "我会安排一下，叫个人去你家接你。", "shortMeaning": "我会安排人到你家接你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67b5b6dc-1eb6-4bef-a1f3-fa6adf3ebc8f", "text": "我会尽可能多给你写信的。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽量多给你写信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ab83bb5-e9ca-4532-96da-90e8b52291e5", "text": "我会尽可能帮你的。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽力帮你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6f6dbba2-2751-48af-80db-388f52e3c0bd", "text": "我会尽可能帮您的。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽力帮您。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cd3478a6-5879-4af6-bbb4-5e9755f5e544", "text": "我会尽可能早地到那儿。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽早到那儿。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa6d58d5-9d77-4bb7-b7f9-0b198f764eea", "text": "我会尽快处理这问题。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽快处理这个问题。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4d99e0b9-db91-411b-b65c-c6e87a9b4dc2", "text": "我会尽快给你打电话的。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽快给你打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d7954412-9798-4bcf-97a0-04af5d56154f", "text": "我会尽量不打扰你复习。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽量不打扰你温习。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af083161-15e6-42e4-9998-bf1e033658e6", "text": "我会带你去安全的地方。", "shortMeaning": "我会把你带到安全处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:476827da-d03b-44cd-b2ec-475cb86bfdd2", "text": "我会帮你买一张演唱会门票。", "shortMeaning": "我会帮你买张演唱会门票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2343e03d-4dc8-447b-b03b-62f7c1a9bdab", "text": "我会帮你应急处理一下。", "shortMeaning": "我会帮你做下应急处理。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8b5171a5-1f8a-46f3-94fc-70111b8a10a4", "text": "我会帮助你好好学习法文。", "shortMeaning": "我会帮你学好法文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d73ab947-2ac6-4993-bc4f-80798d11358a", "text": "我会帮助你找到她。", "shortMeaning": "我会帮你找到她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6fd87d6c-2039-4583-a04e-22905d453886", "text": "我会很想念你们的。", "shortMeaning": "我会非常想念你们。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35f60871-0c4b-44e6-8f9b-1c61770dc374", "text": "我会战斗到最后一口气。", "shortMeaning": "我会拼到最后一口气。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87166028-6531-4283-8bbc-f3da75d91b4a", "text": "我会找到你丢失的戒指。", "shortMeaning": "我会找到你丢的戒指。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9e8f92cc-6942-4c5b-8369-cafcecde075b", "text": "我会把它拿出去的。", "shortMeaning": "我会把它拿出去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a63a5c5a-071a-4231-9ed1-09cc4ea9a437", "text": "我会把它看作一个征兆。", "shortMeaning": "我会把它当作一个征兆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1e86e19-e8a8-450f-89eb-02fb37f82220", "text": "我会把所有有用的信息提供给您的。", "shortMeaning": "我会把所有有用信息提供给您。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bfcaa53b-932a-443d-8930-782b378a2478", "text": "我会把所有有用的信息给你的。", "shortMeaning": "我会把所有有用信息给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:806e609c-af45-44d1-a3d0-8df8f61366ab", "text": "我会把这本书给你。", "shortMeaning": "这本书我会给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43188f9e-0649-4f8a-b22b-418784f77d3f", "text": "我会把这本书邮寄出去。", "shortMeaning": "我会把这本书寄出去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ce2c0690-dba8-49a7-b2c3-62d30ca7bfdb", "text": "我会捍卫我的原则。", "shortMeaning": "我会坚守我的原则。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8f0604ca-ec4b-441a-9ad4-b8a2c68ef7f8", "text": "我会接受他的请求。", "shortMeaning": "我会答应他的请求。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d81b0188-1a23-48e0-9a44-d657e6ffeee8", "text": "我会推迟去苏格兰的行程，直到天变暖一点为止。", "shortMeaning": "我会推迟苏格兰之行，直到天暖和些。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:62183d0a-56df-4cc5-a71f-d0e6417369e7", "text": "我会教你怎么开车。", "shortMeaning": "我会教你开车。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:743bc2be-d57f-40a7-9699-028512d71617", "text": "我会更倾向于第二句话。", "shortMeaning": "我更喜欢第二句话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:85f55aa1-0c26-4fb4-b69a-0c6efff272a6", "text": "我会毫不犹豫嫁给你。", "shortMeaning": "我会毫不犹豫地嫁给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e4a7182-e853-4e77-84d4-aa1b4b8dfd9f", "text": "我会永远比你年轻的。", "shortMeaning": "我会永远比你年轻。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:60d18f3f-01b9-426a-b4d2-7c88fba61a14", "text": "我会永远记得见她的第一次。", "shortMeaning": "我会永远记得第一次见她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6d3f7bc4-93bd-4a60-9f7b-a631148d4996", "text": "我会等在这儿直到他回来。", "shortMeaning": "我会在这里等到他回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9ae8407b-489c-47e4-8e17-1a88d5f0756f", "text": "我会经常去书城看看。", "shortMeaning": "我会常去书城逛逛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:66aa7d37-92f0-49a0-9a3f-4dc96cfaffda", "text": "我会给他一支钢笔。", "shortMeaning": "我会送他一支钢笔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c74e6e16-3abc-4f15-a76d-c30a2b4db2ef", "text": "我会给他买一支铅笔。", "shortMeaning": "我会给他买支铅笔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:992e9dfb-e9f5-46fd-b857-06d3268e9c51", "text": "我会给你你想要的任何事物。", "shortMeaning": "你想要什么我都会给你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3bbbd56-6608-4d34-9878-cfb72a7f1f82", "text": "我会给你回电话的。", "shortMeaning": "我会给你回电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ab2171d-ea62-4fde-8248-b2ba822ac74c", "text": "我会给你寄很多照片，让你感觉就像我在那里陪你一样。", "shortMeaning": "我会给你寄很多照片，让你感觉我就在身边。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8abb0072-fc76-41cc-9689-d7f7fa79bbab", "text": "我会给你开个药方。", "shortMeaning": "我会给你开张处方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08a7d642-45f8-4d94-adcb-6ce4fe9dbf06", "text": "我会给您所有我能提供的帮助。", "shortMeaning": "我会尽力给您一切帮助。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c8bfd76-8f88-4973-8a6c-29ab47567e43", "text": "我会给我的母亲寄封信。", "shortMeaning": "我会给我母亲寄封信。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f3dd887-b073-4ef8-bb47-1f232a815267", "text": "我会自己把它们带过去。", "shortMeaning": "我自己把它们送过去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:844976e1-e9df-4959-a531-9ea28f1e1b3a", "text": "我会让你提前知道。", "shortMeaning": "我会提前让你知道。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ad9b335f-a458-4351-85b5-9f92b3a8b863", "text": "我会让你搭个便车。", "shortMeaning": "我会顺路捎你一程。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0efd8563-c100-4970-8ecf-68bb524cb995", "text": "我会说一点儿苏格兰盖尔语。", "shortMeaning": "我会说一点苏格兰盖尔语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d95c007c-7bfb-465c-a836-e0a1db63e05c", "text": "我会说一点点日语。", "shortMeaning": "我会一点日语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bdef68ca-2072-43ff-a910-62af73c7c524", "text": "我会说世界语和俄语。", "shortMeaning": "我会世界语和俄语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83f3dd92-6229-4872-a182-5f59392a7f97", "text": "我会说古典希腊语。", "shortMeaning": "我懂古典希腊语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2fc5b0ed-b695-430e-9397-40fd0211eb34", "text": "我会说奥斯曼土耳其语。", "shortMeaning": "我会奥斯曼土耳其语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:49dc8f1f-2dd1-4aea-bf6f-fc50571ebf6e", "text": "我会跟着你走到桥那里。", "shortMeaning": "我会跟你走到桥那里。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7f725f0b-14fb-4046-848a-cbdca845bc7f", "text": "我会送你去见上帝。", "shortMeaning": "我会送你上西天。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:16ee7f6a-760e-4d3b-a24f-c519a59334db", "text": "我会问他上周日他去哪儿了。", "shortMeaning": "我会问他上周日去哪儿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7a7e7550-bc30-49ae-b095-ea0f5855911e", "text": "我会需要你的帮助。", "shortMeaning": "我会用得着你的帮助。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3e768214-db6b-4b1c-9a13-28285150ca4b", "text": "我估计我无法及时赶到。", "shortMeaning": "我估计我赶不及了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6c9d945-5db3-46f9-b6cc-5061892f8f4a", "text": "我似乎无法联络上她。", "shortMeaning": "我似乎联系不上她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6b0fa4d3-fdc5-4be5-9109-9a0a3a302f40", "text": "我住在一个大城市里。", "shortMeaning": "我住在一个大城市。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7b684727-0cbf-4621-a722-b2078881b5de", "text": "我住在便利店附近。", "shortMeaning": "我家在便利店附近。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a8569358-89b9-4a71-9a41-759ea2c1ac75", "text": "我住在徐家汇清风花苑。", "shortMeaning": "我住在徐家汇的清风花苑。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b859265c-a34c-44a1-84b1-bea34dba1988", "text": "我住在我的伯父家。", "shortMeaning": "我住在伯父家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:810d3377-49d9-4fe2-966e-aeaedc619176", "text": "我住在格罗宁根城。", "shortMeaning": "我住在格罗宁根市。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b54c0a90-a811-4640-b75d-0c150c12a038", "text": "我住在波士顿，但我出生在芝加哥。", "shortMeaning": "我住在波士顿，但出生在芝加哥。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:528ab3dd-f329-4561-a125-bcbda16d7886", "text": "我住在海边所以经常去海滩。", "shortMeaning": "我住在海边，所以常去海滩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e06f3661-136a-47bb-8dc9-2f2a5d1e7f95", "text": "我住在海边，所以我经常有机会去海滩。", "shortMeaning": "我住在海边，所以常有机会去海滩。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e2d126e-b58d-43b6-a6c9-c901b100c80a", "text": "我住在离波士顿不远的一个农场。", "shortMeaning": "我住在离波士顿不远的农场。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cc80a886-1beb-4199-8b8b-378d83676e25", "text": "我住在那座城市外面。", "shortMeaning": "我住在城外。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a9d46f72-8fbf-49c3-be6b-b9166598fb1d", "text": "我住在马斯特里赫特。", "shortMeaning": "我住在马斯特里赫特市。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1eed6e0b-8402-4c13-b049-03f60237fd39", "text": "我住的城市靠近大海。", "shortMeaning": "我住的城市靠海。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e53d7259-8d74-4d4a-89f2-62a0cc12dc04", "text": "我住的房子不是太大。", "shortMeaning": "我住的房子不算太大。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:065b74c5-d77c-4c20-b278-c9dc816cea4b", "text": "我住的房子是旧的。", "shortMeaning": "我住的房子有些年头了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9a8c221a-7c7f-4e08-be57-a1e75ea5b732", "text": "我使用火狐浏览器。", "shortMeaning": "我用火狐浏览器。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a0fde459-cdc0-4234-8ce3-365f9e6bb123", "text": "我倒想听听你的狗嘴还能出什么象牙来。", "shortMeaning": "我倒想听听你还能说出什么好话来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f941b209-639e-476f-bd1f-6e3814cf2f86", "text": "我借到香港出差的机会去见你，可谓一举两得啊！", "shortMeaning": "我借去香港出差的机会见你，真是一举两得。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5be5fd84-4904-4d64-a2ac-3861c022553c", "text": "我借给他一本杂志。", "shortMeaning": "我借了他一本杂志。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5aa19f8-9466-4578-a44a-5b980e7661a4", "text": "我倾向于看文字前先看图。", "shortMeaning": "我看文字前习惯先看图。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:09db1601-ef04-4e5a-b9d9-41dd9dcd222a", "text": "我假设我对友谊的看法十分灰暗，因为我从来没有真正为了什么事靠过什么人。", "shortMeaning": "我对友谊看法灰暗，因为从没真正依靠过谁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13137e0b-7d21-43a8-a228-793f93d9dd0b", "text": "我做了一个奇怪的梦。", "shortMeaning": "我做了个奇怪的梦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8fefc6de-e73e-49e5-9780-4d52924982fe", "text": "我做到了我承诺要为他们做的事情。", "shortMeaning": "我做到了承诺为他们做的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:894abf0b-d9f8-4666-b7ba-1af94283a834", "text": "我做完我的功课后，就读这本书。", "shortMeaning": "做完功课后我就读这本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7421276a-2dbd-4b79-b281-9f8f85471c4e", "text": "我做得好到不能再好了。", "shortMeaning": "我做得已经好到极点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c3102157-3cf3-4e57-aadf-379df6bef10a", "text": "我做得实在太潦草。", "shortMeaning": "我做得实在太马虎。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0880d619-abad-4518-92de-397b64af7bf2", "text": "我做梦也没想到会在这里见到你。", "shortMeaning": "我做梦也没想到会在这儿见到你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c2f8ee10-3c0f-4464-8abf-e5da0da288af", "text": "我做梦也没想到那儿会有台风。", "shortMeaning": "我做梦也想不到那里会有台风。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0dd482a3-d161-4e5c-ac78-91c8054b740d", "text": "我做梦都没想到能和她在那儿见面。", "shortMeaning": "我做梦都没想到能在那儿见到她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e53867a-7501-42c7-9157-a5af29aa3d0a", "text": "我做的最拿手的菜是烧开水。", "shortMeaning": "我最拿手的菜是烧开水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a7ef136b-dd8e-4f38-8e11-9800d3a14f99", "text": "我做的每件事都要通过他的允许。", "shortMeaning": "我做的每件事都要经他允许。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fbd6e64f-59c3-44fe-aa87-92a61662aee0", "text": "我做的蛋糕不是被你吃了，就是被你妹妹吃了。", "shortMeaning": "我做的蛋糕要么你吃了，要么你妹妹吃了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f43b3bd-86c5-4db3-a29c-ae12464c38ff", "text": "我做钢琴调音师很多年了。", "shortMeaning": "我当钢琴调音师很多年了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e0d924bd-0b0b-43fc-a5b1-6dfd3c345caf", "text": "我停止抽烟和喝酒了。", "shortMeaning": "我戒了烟和酒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4cd97970-26ed-4c5c-936d-eee9e4a20945", "text": "我偶尔会在俱乐部碰到他。", "shortMeaning": "我偶尔会在俱乐部遇见他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c9c29ea5-ccb5-4afb-8207-ab4083109d2c", "text": "我偶然发现了那家餐馆。", "shortMeaning": "我碰巧发现了那家餐馆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:57386073-8173-459e-bb10-0280c65d2631", "text": "我傻乎乎地以为他会帮助我。", "shortMeaning": "我傻傻地以为他会帮我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64452417-e2c7-4753-95ec-0cc14014b08a", "text": "我儿子下周要去法国了。", "shortMeaning": "我儿子下星期去法国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df2d94e5-f6d3-44fb-a671-258f5327be21", "text": "我先想跟你见个面。", "shortMeaning": "我想先跟你见个面。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6add4ca6-d0d8-41d2-8682-7cd33a702675", "text": "我先来北京时，就去哪里都爱逛街，可是北京跟我想象的不一样。", "shortMeaning": "我刚来北京时到处爱逛街，但北京和想象的不一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38b5c3ed-d10d-4de9-bd0e-8d6a71f21b15", "text": "我先游泳，然后去逛街。", "shortMeaning": "我先游泳，然后逛街。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:210d4d1c-991c-4338-b3aa-87520609ce7a", "text": "我先生是一个非常好的厨师。", "shortMeaning": "我先生是个非常好的厨师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:313129d2-0384-4dfc-9cbb-3658ec1e1c83", "text": "我先要去银行，然后去买票。", "shortMeaning": "我要先去银行，再去买票。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c15d9137-9cb6-4646-99c6-342e84a4707f", "text": "我先谢谢你的帮忙。", "shortMeaning": "我先谢谢你帮忙。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:88ba772e-e090-49a3-8645-8a74768171a4", "text": "我全心全意地支持你。", "shortMeaning": "我全心全意支持你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2e20913f-bbcc-42fc-96ea-e5659ff25f13", "text": "我全心全意地爱你。", "shortMeaning": "我全身心地爱你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2bfa790-eae7-4f63-a93e-1d40b4a77daa", "text": "我全心全意地爱着你。", "shortMeaning": "我全身心地爱着你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f7d91a16-9d50-44e7-8fcf-23d14c920459", "text": "我全神贯注地看着外面的风景。", "shortMeaning": "我专注地看着外面的景色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d2a5b671-74fe-4a6e-b216-bd65ac900460", "text": "我六个月前戒的烟。", "shortMeaning": "我六个月前戒了烟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43278a85-9516-4c66-a58a-eaef794b37b0", "text": "我关于日语的知识掌握得还不是很好。", "shortMeaning": "我的日语掌握得还不太好。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:580f725d-c9cf-4601-9fc5-0879094b1b85", "text": "我关机前忘了存盘。", "shortMeaning": "我关机前忘了存档。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2398cd7d-07c9-4b9c-829e-113b9f46a925", "text": "我其实没必要打车来这里。", "shortMeaning": "我其实不必打车来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba162de8-3290-468c-9783-27095d67be84", "text": "我养了一只小宠物。", "shortMeaning": "我养了只小宠物。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f2e3f20e-2c00-4722-a568-11d9818cc2d7", "text": "我养成了9点后不再看电视的习惯。", "shortMeaning": "我养成九点后不看电视的习惯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df939a56-a459-4845-8c1a-8ec65b39cbe1", "text": "我再三申明无罪，但是没人听我讲。", "shortMeaning": "我再三声明无罪，却没人听我说。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1c20e63-c7b7-4f3b-9276-ade8aab86fde", "text": "我再也不会跟你说话了。", "shortMeaning": "我再也不跟你讲话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3d0c4e34-c32f-4783-b938-75d7898485f7", "text": "我再也不会踏进这个地方。", "shortMeaning": "我再也不踏进这地方。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:456baeda-9b15-4bb1-a2a0-25b337a7c4d0", "text": "我再也不和他说话了。", "shortMeaning": "我不再和他说话了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:675abaeb-4ee8-4f7c-89e7-2c1965c55de8", "text": "我再也不想看到她。", "shortMeaning": "我再也不愿见到她。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:045fa986-59b1-447f-bdb0-be22af3d2d6e", "text": "我再也不相信他了。", "shortMeaning": "我不再相信他了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dfe58199-dc53-4db2-a4b1-66c49ab7690a", "text": "我再也不相信任何人了！", "shortMeaning": "我谁也不相信了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b81e9a4-713f-4e18-80d1-a0eb2be3e374", "text": "我再也不知道该做什么了。", "shortMeaning": "我不知道该怎么办了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:91d5a376-7daa-40be-9300-98ba42745559", "text": "我再也受不了那噪音了。", "shortMeaning": "那噪音我再也受不了了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2f57695d-8afb-432e-a1b5-4292c2cbb43b", "text": "我再也忍受不了她了！", "shortMeaning": "我再也受不了她了！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:af8de13e-ef82-42d0-b00f-bacccfd261a6", "text": "我再也想不起来了。", "shortMeaning": "我怎么也想不起来了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0bb8a516-7907-43f2-afea-dd06b499a8b6", "text": "我再也无法相信任何人了。", "shortMeaning": "我无法再相信任何人了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:38ecc276-b642-406b-9aef-c4beb0508ac4", "text": "我再也没有灵感了。", "shortMeaning": "我的灵感没了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:bcae2ac4-69e2-4a26-9342-9eff810553e2", "text": "我再拿块毛巾过来。", "shortMeaning": "我再拿条毛巾来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1b3d6b4c-8961-44c5-9131-4aa8c3955834", "text": "我再给你一次机会。", "shortMeaning": "我再给你个机会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6bc05bd1-6d52-48f6-83d0-343b828a6700", "text": "我再给你重复最后一遍。", "shortMeaning": "我再给你说最后一遍。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:94c50201-e468-4d7e-904e-3f174f80be56", "text": "我写了一封情书给她。", "shortMeaning": "我给她写了封情书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:292fa627-bef7-4430-b28c-6362ffef36e9", "text": "我写了封信，叫他早点回。", "shortMeaning": "我写信叫他早点回来。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fa306b60-465b-459d-a0d7-85249dece184", "text": "我写什么是我的事。", "shortMeaning": "写什么是我自己的事。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6cc3e0de-3107-4aeb-97df-677e89af459d", "text": "我写的漫画下载器本周日就发布。", "shortMeaning": "我写的漫画下载器本周日发布。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0298e893-1d69-4432-ac84-b12440ff1166", "text": "我军似潮水般大踏步前进。", "shortMeaning": "我军如潮水般大步前进。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:87b722bc-2e02-46fe-be1f-662eb85d1d91", "text": "我决定上大学主修英语。", "shortMeaning": "我决定大学主修英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:713dff59-fb4d-4375-b5b1-19f239c694cf", "text": "我决定不去欧洲了。", "shortMeaning": "我决定取消欧洲之行。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ba706238-2de7-4de7-b337-8c3416ffab7e", "text": "我决定去美国，而不是欧洲。", "shortMeaning": "我决定去美国而不是欧洲。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3c8f5d73-c170-466e-b8df-35d5761f3988", "text": "我决定告诉她我爱她。", "shortMeaning": "我决定向她表白。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:586a0435-aa00-4032-9691-c685c67bf5f5", "text": "我决定当个工程师。", "shortMeaning": "我决定当工程师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3de60430-c758-43ec-8b01-40b0f82da8e6", "text": "我决定顺便去看望看望他。", "shortMeaning": "我决定顺便去看看他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:777b4552-8260-4373-a123-890c1b973df8", "text": "我准备再前进一点。", "shortMeaning": "我准备再往前一点。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8926c2ac-cf3b-4f32-8c40-2d3f9a490bea", "text": "我准备好了承担后果。", "shortMeaning": "我准备好承担后果了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:32ad3ff6-57a3-40cd-8397-3f9254c3edf3", "text": "我准备好了，你们呢？", "shortMeaning": "我准备好了，你们怎么样？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9bd38e68-d055-4c01-b4b2-560251a479e8", "text": "我准备徒步去市中心。", "shortMeaning": "我准备步行去市中心。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:994933d0-63cc-4877-9616-a205f7e7602a", "text": "我几个月没见过他了。", "shortMeaning": "我几个月没见到他了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd6d1d4d-64cb-4500-8165-dcd987217498", "text": "我几乎不去博物馆。", "shortMeaning": "我很少去博物馆。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3134ad3b-06a7-41a3-b218-70d106919f9c", "text": "我几乎不能理解他。", "shortMeaning": "我几乎听不懂他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:41a080ab-c8fb-4018-b174-2d7a1456de5a", "text": "我几乎忘记是他的生日。", "shortMeaning": "我差点忘了是他的生日。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b5d51786-0d9a-4acd-adf2-635c2db5e7ec", "text": "我几乎怕跟你说话。", "shortMeaning": "我差点不敢跟你说话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fb2ededf-ec6f-478e-a5b0-36b2a3303a7c", "text": "我几乎每天都见到那条狗。", "shortMeaning": "我几乎每天见到那条狗。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1051327-7bb5-498b-abf4-00c89d8a46da", "text": "我凭韧性克服了困难。", "shortMeaning": "我靠韧劲克服了困难。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:554e7f3f-9286-4e08-beff-24166b81de9b", "text": "我出去的时候有人打我电话吗？", "shortMeaning": "我出去时有人打我电话吗？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1bccba6e-2fa5-4df2-b3e2-703313a875e4", "text": "我出生在二十年前。", "shortMeaning": "我二十年前出生。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67c16401-d6c6-4ba7-80f7-89d81a6f8868", "text": "我出生在浦东新区。", "shortMeaning": "我是在浦东新区出生的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c363cc37-fc3b-4ea7-8b43-015889e5651d", "text": "我出生的城市以它的古老的城堡们而闻名。", "shortMeaning": "我出生的城市以古老的城堡闻名。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8a6fd901-50da-49f2-a54a-2ac8eb08e195", "text": "我出门不喜欢带很多行李。", "shortMeaning": "我出门不爱带太多行李。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:aaa6c0f5-3792-46bc-8018-ed97f71348ff", "text": "我分不出他的衬衫是什么颜色的，因为外头太黑了。", "shortMeaning": "外头太黑，我分不出他衬衫的颜色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13e3220d-758c-448a-84b5-39ed0f19834f", "text": "我刚一离开商店，就碰到了我的老师。", "shortMeaning": "我刚离开商店就碰到了老师。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ffff3c0c-8433-46a6-b3f0-d8998f7087e6", "text": "我刚刚发了一篇文章。", "shortMeaning": "我刚发了一篇文章。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6eb221de-3e65-4d34-811f-5c06652e25b6", "text": "我刚刚被蚊子咬了。", "shortMeaning": "我刚被蚊子咬了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7df48b6e-6e13-411f-9303-1dba4eec8735", "text": "我刚刚读完这本书。", "shortMeaning": "我刚读完这本书。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5b53a3c-76dc-41b1-ab09-22555b19db0e", "text": "我刚到广州时，因不懂广州话，常常闹笑话。", "shortMeaning": "刚到广州时因不懂粤语常闹笑话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d94f76fd-1d6b-455e-8014-408169894c12", "text": "我刚发现你能讲法语。", "shortMeaning": "我刚发现你会讲法语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ec5dce63-cca9-4915-ad10-f8337454907c", "text": "我刚才在树林里散步时看见了一只漂亮的孔雀在开屏。", "shortMeaning": "我刚在树林散步时看见一只孔雀在开屏。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4cd41ee9-cfe2-49af-8fca-47a0bb6919a4", "text": "我刚打开锅盖，一股恶臭就扑鼻而来。", "shortMeaning": "我刚揭开锅盖就闻到一股恶臭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6a090432-1791-4239-93c7-716d3d675241", "text": "我刚把你家的卫生做完。", "shortMeaning": "我刚把你家打扫完。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a94e8c52-f1c5-4ab5-9d36-20c2346c8e4f", "text": "我刚看到一颗流星。", "shortMeaning": "我刚看见一颗流星。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:06f660b9-2de8-4dda-91b2-f7337d007578", "text": "我刚看到沙特阿拉伯驻华盛顿大使辞职了。", "shortMeaning": "我刚看到沙特驻华盛顿大使辞职了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f01dbcd2-7b8f-4a15-8963-dc188275052d", "text": "我刚说了很蠢的话。", "shortMeaning": "我刚说了句蠢话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9e58e4c-fbfc-4674-a513-da417e521fda", "text": "我刚跟主管人谈过。", "shortMeaning": "我刚跟主管谈过。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4f202e47-0da7-4cb1-a160-29b7fd07c50a", "text": "我删除了这个应用。", "shortMeaning": "我把这个应用删了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14a8301d-8884-4ee7-90fb-c798be774aa2", "text": "我利用了这个好机会。", "shortMeaning": "我抓住了这个好机会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b81bcc8b-37a0-49eb-987b-a84afb5ee2e9", "text": "我到东京是两个月前。", "shortMeaning": "我两个月前到的东京。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:10bcf039-56a9-4780-84e0-e7bd5223f796", "text": "我到处都看了，可还是没找到我的皮夹。", "shortMeaning": "我到处找，还是没找到皮夹。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:54ef4432-f4d9-4ca8-92d9-e81dc0c38709", "text": "我到家后给你打电话。", "shortMeaning": "我回家后给你打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a6084635-1787-48c7-93e0-5d00ce0ee73d", "text": "我到家给你打电话。", "shortMeaning": "我回到家就给你打电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1c0aa812-8d3d-4871-b05a-e5386f60bffa", "text": "我到底不明白，他人怎么能了解中文。", "shortMeaning": "我始终不明白别人怎么能弄懂中文。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:211e8573-d3ba-420f-acf5-4080b003478f", "text": "我到旅馆的时候，天已经黑了。", "shortMeaning": "我到旅馆时天已经黑了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0f688224-e352-4a6f-a7a9-b42a75de1546", "text": "我到理发店剪了头发。", "shortMeaning": "我去理发店剪了头发。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:40ee72af-34ef-4b9f-a934-92ff6811d791", "text": "我前一天丢了一台相机。", "shortMeaning": "我前一天丢了台相机。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:37b9f72e-46d4-4ed1-bee1-b321e03a2b12", "text": "我前天到达成田市。", "shortMeaning": "我前天到的成田市。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:73e5942a-5642-4932-9244-6170e3979dcd", "text": "我劝他别老想着啃老。", "shortMeaning": "我劝他别总想啃老。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9c937b2-ede3-4a75-aac0-c53e183bb207", "text": "我劝告你别吃那个。", "shortMeaning": "我劝你别吃那个。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:98d5a0b2-5864-4c2b-b66d-d61b1afb7ee9", "text": "我办完事会立刻联络你。", "shortMeaning": "我办完事立刻联系你。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7d4d8afb-2441-4c9f-a26e-6c826547bb60", "text": "我加了新的中文翻译。", "shortMeaning": "我添加了新的中文翻译。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c189706d-f939-45c4-9600-f60728911e43", "text": "我加入了冒险者公会。", "shortMeaning": "我加入了冒险者行会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f3f51a4a-1ec9-41f3-9eb3-8b9b4895e82e", "text": "我加入了橄榄球社团。", "shortMeaning": "我加入了橄榄球社。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:55424293-8c92-45f0-9b66-9e44ca6e4d9f", "text": "我加粗了我觉得有趣的文章。", "shortMeaning": "我把觉得有趣的文章加粗了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0993c3ff-d4e7-4d0b-8bfc-bc3aec80c6c7", "text": "我努力劝他远离那个计划，但是他不听。", "shortMeaning": "我劝他别碰那个计划，但他不听。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5d2a0617-1440-4b47-bea7-2d312b4babe3", "text": "我匆匆忙忙地穿上和服。", "shortMeaning": "我匆匆穿上和服。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dd3f2d0c-1ba6-492f-a786-21f2088dc149", "text": "我匆忙的吃了午餐。", "shortMeaning": "我匆忙吃了午饭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:35eca86c-640e-49c0-9967-b31164fc5ef1", "text": "我十分了解他想要说什么。", "shortMeaning": "我很清楚他想说什么。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67198342-2f15-4c8c-9acd-e61a05ac5d22", "text": "我十分感谢你的好意。", "shortMeaning": "我非常感谢你的好意。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d66486a2-1295-47ac-905f-6926c58d842e", "text": "我半小时后回来，所以我应该来得及去音乐会。", "shortMeaning": "我半小时后回来，应该赶得上去音乐会。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43cb2c0a-f235-4bff-b068-354c5f2e6ae8", "text": "我单飞的日子过厌啦！", "shortMeaning": "我过腻了单飞的日子！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8668a4b2-2936-4721-a30d-0a72cd2f3e90", "text": "我卖了房子和家具，连同我的手饰一起才凑了五十万。", "shortMeaning": "我卖了房子、家具和首饰才凑够五十万。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0e1d1bf6-570e-4faa-8df8-b2abdba60c88", "text": "我厌倦了他的老笑话。", "shortMeaning": "我听腻了他的老笑话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2be46395-5a94-4288-b6e1-02cbf0c0f33a", "text": "我厌倦了现在单调的生活。", "shortMeaning": "我腻烦了单调的生活。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f5087a8-1dd8-4403-8e63-42e6b9e197b0", "text": "我厌倦了这种生活。", "shortMeaning": "我过腻了这种日子。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:84cccb78-8c78-4c6c-b60a-1d3817556a01", "text": "我厌恶每个人，每个人都厌恶我。", "shortMeaning": "我厌恶每个人，每个人也厌恶我。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c5680b72-4ca4-402f-bf52-2d09b9ab25c6", "text": "我厌烦了他的行为。", "shortMeaning": "他的行为让我厌烦。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e406e26c-4d39-43ed-8901-a15ce2e1b90e", "text": "我厌烦了他的长篇大论。", "shortMeaning": "我听厌了他的长篇大论。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5cf1875f-6f65-4d63-ba55-13e27e7050d4", "text": "我去不了，也不想去。", "shortMeaning": "我去不成，也不想去。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
